WEBVTT

00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:04.462
Welcome to the Medical Assistance in Dying accountability dossier.

00:00:04.412 --> 00:00:11.087
Over 60,167 Canadians have died under this program since its inception.

00:00:11.087 --> 00:00:19.375
This dossier maps the 1,467 percent growth rate and highlights the total absence of independent oversight.
